From 1c4c56368babd488235c948213cb99fb6d87e19a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:33:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] Connect baseline and collector build
 outputs

Add thin Make and Soong integration for ASTER's baseline, signer and optional
source-built collector outputs. Keep generation rules under external/aster.

Track collector header inputs in kernel header generation and record the final
installed module paths for baseline construction. Require a full kernel build
when the source-built collector is selected and forward the nested source and
output configuration to the kernel build.

Change-Id: I9adc974d424eb906ef2a0c4475185b63d27ca7ba
---
